   "notes": [
    "OUT Low Voltage: the unit should read mV.",
    "Note 1: Every unit is tested at TA = +25 °C; limits over temperature are set by design.",
    "Note 2: VREF is the mean of VREF1A and VREF1B; REF1B normally goes to REF1A or to GND. VSENSE = VRS+ - VRS-.",
    "Note 3: The 4.5 V lower limit of the common-mode range applies to whichever of RS+ and RS- is higher. The other input may sit below 4.5 V by up to the typical full-scale VSENSE, depending on gain and sense polarity.",
