    "Note 5: VSENSE range of the test: MAX4080F 10 mV to 1000 mV; MAX4080T 10 mV to 250 mV; MAX4080S 10 mV to 100 mV; MAX4081F -500 mV to +500 mV; MAX4081T -125 mV to +125 mV; MAX4081S -50 mV to +50 mV.",
